---

TASK: Extract a detailed Bill of Materials from this garment specification.

GARMENT SPEC:
{{ spec | tojson(indent=2) }}

For each material required:
- item: material name
- category: "fabric" | "lining" | "interfacing" | "notions" | "trims" | "labels" | "packaging"
- quantity: amount with unit (e.g. "2.5 meters", "12 pieces", "1 roll")
- specification: detailed spec (e.g. "100% Cotton, 60s count, 114cm wide, pre-shrunk")
- color: color name or code
- estimated_cost_inr: rough cost estimate in Indian Rupees (optional)

Return as JSON array.
